  "bio": "Step into the world of precise artistry at La Rubia Tattoo, where realism transcends the boundaries of skin and ink. Nestled in Barcelona's Cerdanyola district, this tattoo haven offers a fusion of body modification services including expertly crafted tattoos, micro pigmentation, piercings, and aesthetic treatments. Open from Tuesday to Friday, 10 am-2 pm/4 pm-8 pm, and Saturdays from 9 am-1 pm, La Rubia Tattoo awaits to transform your ideas into enduring masterpieces.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTATTOO•Estética•Láser•MICROPIGMENTACIÓN •Piercing\n 𝐌𝐚𝐫𝐭𝐞𝐬 𝐚 𝐕𝐢𝐞𝐫𝐧𝐞𝐬10a14h/16a20h 𝐒𝐀𝐁 9a13h \n Reserva/info 𝐂𝐋𝐈𝐂 𝐀𝐐𝐔Í👇\n\nTATTOO•Estética•Láser•MICROPIGMENTACIÓN •Piercing\n 𝐌𝐚𝐫𝐭𝐞𝐬 𝐚 𝐕𝐢𝐞𝐫𝐧𝐞𝐬10a14h/16a20h 𝐒𝐀𝐁 9a13h \n Reserva/info 𝐂𝐋𝐈𝐂 𝐀𝐐𝐔Í👇",
